  terms:{title:'Terms of Service',intro:'These terms explain how Maxrez accepts, produces, stores, delivers, and supports printing and design orders.',sections:[['Quotes and orders','Online prices are estimates based on the selected specification. Final production begins after artwork review, confirmation, and any required payment. Custom requirements may change the quote.'],['Artwork and approvals','Customers must have permission to reproduce submitted content. Maxrez may pause unlawful, unsafe, infringing, or technically unsuitable work. Approval of a proof confirms spelling, layout, quantity, dimensions, colors, and finishing.'],['Production tolerances','Printed color can vary slightly from screens and between production runs. Cutting, folding, binding, and material batches may have normal commercial tolerances.'],['Pickup and delivery','Customers may collect completed work from our facility or request delivery. Production and delivery estimates are targets, not guarantees, unless Maxrez confirms a written service commitment.'],['Customer content','Customer artwork is used only to quote, review, produce, support, and—where permission is given—reproduce future orders.']]},
